    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**n8n Workflow: Telegram Prompt to KIE API Video Generation**\n\n**What This Workflow Does**\n\nThis workflow takes a message from a user on Telegram, improves the prompt using Gemini, sends it to the KIE API to generate a video, and automatically delivers the finished video back to the user. It also logs important details in Google Sheets for tracking.\n\n**Telegram Trigger**\n\nThe workflow starts when a user sends a prompt to the Telegram bot.\n\n**Gemini – Prompt Enhancement**\n\nThe user’s message is sent to Gemini, which rewrites and improves the prompt to make it more effective for video generation.\n\n**Google Sheets – Logging**\n\nThe workflow saves the image URL and the current date in a Google Sheet.\nThis helps keep a record of every request made.\n\n**Function Node – Format to JSON**\n\nThe improved prompt and related data are converted into JSON format so they can be properly sent to the API.\n\n**KIE API – POST Request**\n\nThe optimized prompt and image URL are sent to the KIE API using a POST request.\nThis starts the video generation process.\n\n**KIE API – GET Request (Status Check)**\n\nAfter 15 seconds, a GET request checks whether the video is ready.\n\nIf the video is completed, it is automatically sent to the user on Telegram.\n\nIf it is not ready yet, the workflow loops back and keeps checking until the video is finished.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
        "height": 848,
        "width": 560
      },
